<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1979</h1><p class="ref-lede">1979 in world history: 25 events, 19 deaths, 2 works, 5 states founded and 7 that came to an end. 206 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
